800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GtK8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c9dde4c-812a-4a36-82d1-4311c1e8ec9c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そもそも巨大なファイルを一気にリストに変換はしない方がよいですよ","ts":"1635763770.247400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pDDi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f96ad8b-5c66-41ee-a9a0-5210303963e5","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"バイト数いくらですか","ts":"1635763746.246000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oZdeq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"506708d8-68f6-42b4-9ecd-0d1549312d03","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"行数でみるのはちょっと危険かもしれない","ts":"1635763742.245700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jKipA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"571840bc-faa3-4e7a-aa7c-d90cc6be3c3c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ちなみにイテレータとしてぶん回したらどうなります？\nパフォーマンスは別として","ts":"1635763673.243800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HCwK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da109aee-a27c-4850-a56c-729410862bae","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"一行が極めて長いってわけでもないです","ts":"1635763660.243500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"itKH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41037017-34d0-4e17-928b-19b2e450423e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"とくにエラーが出るということもなく、単に途中までしか読んでくれないです","ts":"1635763645.243000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sa0d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dad95255-6cd3-42fe-a71d-39b5782b5651","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あと20GBくらいは空いてますね…","ts":"1635763625.242300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_t