"fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/python/cpython/blob/bb3e0c240bc60fe08d332ff5955d54197f79751c/Objects/unicodectype.c | unicodectype.c\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/python/cpython/blob/bb3e0c240bc60fe08d332ff5955d54197f79751c/Objects/unicodectype.c | unicodectype.c\u003e","text":"```\nPy_UCS4 _PyUnicode_ToTitlecase(Py_UCS4 ch)\n{\n    const _PyUnicode_TypeRecord *ctype = gettyperecord(ch);\n\n    if (ctype-\u0026gt;flags \u0026amp; EXTENDED_CASE_MASK)\n        return _PyUnicode_ExtendedCase[ctype-\u0026gt;title \u0026amp; 0xFFFF];\n    return ch + ctype-\u0026gt;title;\n}\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/python/cpython|python/cpython\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SXcZF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5399bb1-75ed-409d-b434-372753dc51f8","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"そもそも英字タイトルのルールがややこしいのが悪いので、そっちを改めてほしいという気持ちはありますね…\n\u003chttps://www.sanctio.net/capitalization/#index_id2\u003e","ts":"1635735139.235100","attachments":[{"fallback":"Englishに英語: 【これで完璧】英語タイトルの大文字ルール ☆11の注意点☆ | Englishに英語","id":1,"title":"【これで完璧】英語タイトルの大文字ルール ☆11の注意点☆ | Englishに英語","title_link":"https://www.sanctio.net/capitalization/#index_id2","text":"英語のタイトルを書くときに知っておかないといけないのがキャピタライゼーションルール(capitalization rules)です（動詞はcapitalize）。タイトルや見出しに大文字を使うルールです。すべて大文字の英語タイトルを見かけることもありますが、 (例) DIURNAL VARIATION OF SUMMER RAINFALL OVER EAST CHINA, KOREA AND JAPAN ふつうはタイトルケース(title case)もしくはセンテンスケース(sentence case)のルールに従って表記されます。センテンスケースでは通常の英文を書くように最初の単語と固有名詞","thumb_url":"https://www.sanctio.net/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/015.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Englishに英語","service_icon":"https://www.sanctio.net/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/cropped--180x180.jpg","thumb_width":640,"thumb_height":360,"from_url":"https://www.sanctio.net/capitalization/#index_id2","original_url":"https://www.sanctio.net/capitalization/#index_id2"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gQKex"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0df79cd-d3c1-448b-ba66-f4b624764b8a","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"なんで存在するのかは知らないですw","ts":"1635735107.234700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"usfx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dec53597-cf76-48f6-a2d0-4e44e8336def","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"\u003chttps://www.nltk.org|形態素解析\u003e　と組み合わせると良さそうですね","ts":"1635735101.234500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YJHXe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d2be97b-5822-4188-a6fc-c13442606089","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なんか残念感が。。","ts":"1635735090.234100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Cl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f21c485-93e5-4514-ada2-346aa8d55150","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"```\u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; \"naoya's emacs\".title()\n\"Naoya'S Emacs\"```\nこういう仕様だったりします","ts":"1635735060.233400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/dgeE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f2e2e9b-0a73-4574-8e3d-387e1123a2a4","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"```print(\"HeLLo tHe woRld\".title())\n=\u0026gt; Hello The World```\n残念。。","ts":"1635734914.232400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0lL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ade26bed-654c-41e1-8d4f-ccef5c96126a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"はじめてみた。前置詞とかは小文字でキープしてくれるんだろうか（じゃないと実用性という意味では微妙）","ts":"1635734791.232000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qRuP0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24d28736-525d-4e9b-9199-f8643ab3f46a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ハマるところではすごいちゃんとハマりそう","ts":"1635734773.231400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gs4So"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe02d2f1-c8e1-4573-849e-22253762588c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"jekyllとかそういうブログジェネレータなら実装されててもわからんではないんですが。。","ts":"1635734756.230500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yAK=S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a851b41-ab03-49b0-b4d4-74841c907781","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"稀に使うます :wink:","ts":"1635734714.229900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SSpLL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b45b688-4c17-4a80-9702-a37a1b16e3ef","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"です。今日stackoverflowを探検してたら回答で使っている人がいて驚きました。","ts":"1635734654.229300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7G6k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d62d6802-a116-4b08-9d0f-930f1fa297e5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、単語毎なのか","ts":"1635734608.228500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"loo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce8f39a6-bf7d-4993-9cab-93cd4e2aaf7f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"や、Capitalizeは普通にありますね。これは単語ごとにCapitalizeするという別メソッドがあるという話です。普通ならユーザーが勝手に作れとなりそう","ts":"1635734587.228300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8akiI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbacaa44-65a4-4c91-b255-903f231fbd4a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"見たことない気がしますね(単に必要性感じないので見逃してるだけかも)","ts":"1635734551.227400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I94R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d295113-c11e-4ee0-98e9-9e2cf468e46f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"同等のやつでCaptalizeがある言語があったような、なかったような...","ts":"1635734548.227200","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1635734573.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gn36D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fc47700-260f-496c-bcd3-7648785d970b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"全角英字も変換してくれるのか。。","ts":"1635734544.226900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aVj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e3e036b-0b2e-4abf-97e3-631c25c9df3b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://note.nkmk.me/python-capitalize-lower-upper-title/#strtitle\u003e\n`str.title()` とかいう謎メソッドを見つけました。他の言語では普通用意されてないですよね？\n```s_org = 'pYThon proGramminG laNguAge'\n\nprint(s_org.title())\n# Python Programming Language```","ts":"1635734510.225800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Pythonで大文字・小文字を操作する文字列メソッド一覧 | note.nkmk.me","id":1,"title":"Pythonで大文字・小文字を操作する文字列メソッド一覧 | note.nkmk.me","title_link":"https://note.nkmk.me/python-capitalize-lower-upper-title/#strtitle","text":"Pythonの文字列型（str型）には大文字・小文字を操作する便利なメソッドが標準で用意されている。大文字と小文字を変換したり判定したりできる。組み込み型: 文字列メソッド — Python 3.7.2 ドキュメント ここでは以下の内容について説明する。大文字と小文字の変換基本的な使い方全角と半角の扱いstr.upper(): すべての文...","image_url":"https://i.gyazo.com/9b55f5c9b4ee9a01dedd17abfe8f684b.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"note.nkmk.me","from_url":"https://note.nkmk.me/python-capitalize-lower-upper-title/#strtitle","original_url":"https://note.nkmk.me/python-capitalize-lower-upper-title/#strtitle"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"as7+"}]}]
